# Force optional dependencies to be installed and kept in the lockfile.
#
# jest's file resolver relies on a platform-specific *optional* native binding,
# so optional deps cannot be omitted (that breaks `npm test`). This overrides a
# machine-level `omit=optional` setting so local installs stay complete.
#
# NOTE: the lockfile must be COMPLETE for the Linux Cloudflare build / CI, which
# run `npm ci`. A local `npm install` on macOS can prune the Linux-only
# @img/sharp-wasm32 -> @emnapi subtree; if that pruned lock is committed, `npm ci`
# on Linux fails with "Missing: @emnapi/... from lock file". See README
# "Updating dependencies" for how to keep it complete.
include=optional
